<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>

<!-- using the ferny namespace for consistency even though i'm not ferny

shoving everything related to a specific HAR race into its own categry feels tacky, but after asking in maincord, this was what seemed to be most useful to people using lots of HAR races. as it stands they need to sort through every tab and read the extended info to pair architect menu gizmos to races
-->

